<%--
Test_Cache_Key_Content - plain-data object args are cacheable end to end

Object/array args used to null the cache key, silently opting the component out of
cache reuse. They are now keyed by deterministic content. Values that cannot be
expressed exactly still decline, and the reason reaches data-nocache.
--%>
<Define:Test_Cache_Key_Content>
  <h2>Cache Key Content Serialization</h2>
  <Ck_Child $sid="plain" $params=this.state.params />
  <Ck_Child $sid="fn" $params=this.state.with_fn />
  <div $sid="results"></div>
</Define:Test_Cache_Key_Content>
